{"id":"G2523","lemma":"καθίζω","transliteration":"kathizō","sayIt":"kathizō","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to seat","meaning":"καθ-ίζω\n[in LXX chiefly for יָשַׁב ;]\n1. causal, to make to sit down, set, appoint: Act.2:30, 1Co.6:4, Eph.1:20.\n2. Intrans., to sit down, be seated, sit: Mat.5:1, Mrk.9:35, Luk.7:15, Jhn.8:2, al.; with inf. tel., 1Co.10:7; before εἰς, 2Th.2:4; ἐπί, with accusative, Mrk.11:2, Jhn.12:14; id. with genitive, Jhn.19:13, Act.12:21; ὧδε, Mrk.14:32; αὐτοῦ, Mat.26:36; ἐν δεξιᾷ, Heb.1:3; ἐκ δεξιῶν, Mat.20:21, 23; ἐν, Rev.3:21; καθίσας pleonastic (M, Pro.14:1-35; Dalman, Words, 22), Mat.13:48, Luk.5:3 14:31 16:6; of settling in a place (ἐς χωρίον, Thuc., iv, 93), before ἐν, Luk.24:49 (cf. ἀνα-, ἐπι-, παρα-, περι-, συν-καθίζω)\n(AS)","glosses":["sat down","sit","sat","sitting down","may sit","sit down"],"count":43,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"sat down","kjv":"was set"}},{"chapterId":"mat-13","v":48,"renderings":{"bsb":"they sat down","kjv":"sat down"}},{"chapterId":"mat-19","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"sits","kjv":"shall sit"}},{"chapterId":"mat-20","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"may sit","kjv":"may sit"}},{"chapterId":"mat-20","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"to sit","kjv":"to sit"}},{"chapterId":"mat-23","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"sit","kjv":"sit"}},{"chapterId":"mat-25","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"He will sit","kjv":"shall he sit"}},{"chapterId":"mat-26","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Sit","kjv":"Sit ye"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-9","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"Sitting down","kjv":"he sat down"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-10","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"may sit","kjv":"e may sit"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-10","v":40,"renderings":{"bsb":"to sit","kjv":"to sit"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-11","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"has ever sat","kjv":"sat"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-11","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"He sat","kjv":"he sat"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-12","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Jesus was sitting","kjv":"sat"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-14","v":32,"rende